      </entryLinks>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Chaos Dreadnought" id="3373-e992-fd83-04be" hidden="false" targetId="bd67-5605-75f7-aa6a" type="profile">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="2870-c64f-81e5-a118" type="set" value="6">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="927f-d992-cab3-b66b" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1" />
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
            <modifier field="bb33-7ddf-2296-174e" type="set" value="4">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="da08-0a9a-08a7-cbc3" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1" />
                    <condition childId="bf56-a14e-f594-34cf" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1" />
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
            <modifier field="bb33-7ddf-2296-174e" type="set" value="2">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="927f-d992-cab3-b66b" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="1" />
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
        </infoLink>
      </infoLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Fire Frenzy" id="0b40-89bc-59d3-0e69" hidden="false">
          <description>At the start of the Movement phase, before moving the Dreadnought roll a D6 and consult the chart below:
1 - Blood Rage: The Dreadnought must move 6+D6" towards the nearest enemy model or unit, but cannot shoot this turn. It must assault this unit if able, and it will double its basic Attacks characteristic this turn. If the Dreadnought is immobilized and not in melee treat this result as Fire Frenzy instead.
2-5 - Move and shoot normally
6 - Fire Frenzy: The Dreadnought may not move or assault this turn, but instead shoots all of its weapons TWICE at the nearest enemy model or unit. If no enemy targets are visible or in range it will instead fire at the nearest friendly unit it can target. If the Dreadnought has no functional ranged weapons, or no possible targets within range, treat this result as Blood Rage instead.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Arm Weapon" id="9fe6-43e8-2312-a31e" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="1">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="ea1d-034f-350c-70cc" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1" />
